\f3\b \cf0 \outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 The Cost of Constant Approval
\f2\b0 \
We all crave understanding and companionship.\uc0\u8232 But what happens when we prioritize being liked above all else?\
At first glance, this mindset seems harmless\'97even kind.\uc0\u8232 Yet it can be deeply damaging.\
When someone shares their thoughts, three core needs usually drive them:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 To be heard.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 To receive advice.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 To seek validation.\
\pard\tx566\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Lately, however, the third need has become the most common.\uc0\u8232 It stems from a hunger for ego reinforcement and external approval.\
\uc0\u8232 But have you ever paused to consider its hidden costs?\
Without real listening\'97one that includes honest, constructive feedback\'97\uc0\u8232 your worldview narrows, your openness fades, and your growth stalls.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b \cf0 \strokec5 AI chat systems thrive on this very flaw.
\f2\b0 \strokec5 \uc0\u8232 They always agree with you, no matter what.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 News reports occasionally expose the extreme outcomes of this pattern.\uc0\u8232 Yet danger doesn\'92t require extremes to take root.\
Awareness is the first step toward avoiding the trap.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
